# Tech Stack Mapper

Purpose:
  Tech Stack Mapper

Skill: Tech Stack Mapper

ID:
  PROMPT-TECH-STACK-MAPPER

Domain:
  prompts/tech-stack

Use:
  extracting and mapping technologies from case.tech_stack

Apply:
  all-cases
  role-assignment
  provisioning

Requires:
  case-with-tech_stack

Avoid:
  missing-tech_stack
  invalid-tech
  ambiguous-mapping

Level:
  L1

Status:
  STABLE

Maturity:
  MATURE

Risk:
  LOW

Review:
  2026-08

Version:
  1.0

EvidenceLevel:
  HIGH

SearchKeys:
  tech stack
  technology mapping
  role assignment
  skill resolution

TechnologyLifecycle:
  Current: MATURE

HumanDoc:
  docs/prompts/tech-stack-mapper.md

Evidence:
  - SDDRA tech stack definitions
  - Production experience

Rules:
  [T1] Extract all technologies from case.tech_stack.
  [T2] Group technologies by category (language, framework, database, platform, messaging, cross-cutting).
  [T3] Resolve each technology to its skill path in .sdd/skills/.
  [T4] Identify primary and secondary roles per technology.
  [T5] Identify provisioning requirements per technology.
  [T6] Validate all skill paths exist before proceeding.
  [T7] Flag missing or ambiguous technologies for human review.
  [T8] Output structured tech_map for role assignment.

Pros:
  - Accurate skill resolution
  - Clear role mapping
  - Automated provisioning prep

Cons:
  - Requires complete tech_stack
  - New tech needs manual mapping

Alternatives:
  - Manual skill loading
  - Agent-based discovery

State: +

